OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be a largely dry and
OL,6,Fbright day with some good sunny
OL,7,Fspells, though the sunshine turning
OL,8,Foccasionally hazy. Chance of the odd
OL,9,Fbrief shower at times. Becoming very
OL,10,Fwarm or hot, with light winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FIt will stay mostly dry
OL,13,Fovernight with a few clear spells at
OL,14,Ftimes and just the small chance of the
OL,15,Fodd brief shower.
OL,16,
OL,17,CThursday:FAnother very warm day.
OL,18,FMainly dry and bright with some sunny
OL,19,Fspells, though the sunshine turning
OL,20,Fhazy at times. Small chance of the odd
OL,21,Fpassing shower.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
